#
# Render tests (WI-1.400 onward). Catch2's CHECK/REQUIRE/SKIP/FAIL macros expand to branches, so helpers and test
# cases trip readability-function-cognitive-complexity on code that has little control flow of its own. Count only
# the test's own branches (as core/tests/bitreader/.clang-tidy does).
InheritParentConfig: true
CheckOptions:
  readability-function-cognitive-complexity.IgnoreMacros: true
